---
description: Frontend rules for TanStack Start + React
globs: apps/web/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- File-based routes mirror the current URL structure (see `docs/migration/04-frontend-tanstack.md` §2). Keep paths identical to the Django URLs they replace.
- Server state exclusively via TanStack Query; query keys defined in `packages/shared/src/query-keys.ts`.
- Optimistic updates must implement rollback on mutation error.
- Forms: react-hook-form + zod resolvers derived from `packages/shared` schemas.
- All API calls go through `src/lib/api.ts` with `credentials: 'include'`; no other fetch wrappers.
- Business logic belongs in the API — components only render state and call mutations.
- Port HTMX patterns as documented: partial swaps → mutations + invalidation; infinite scroll → `useInfiniteQuery`; drag-and-drop → `@dnd-kit` with optimistic move; notification badge → 30 s refetch interval.
- Visual parity with the current product is a requirement, not a nice-to-have.
